‹Heading1,b:Plan: a link checker for the site›
‹Heading1,b:builder›
‹Rule:────────────────────────────────────────›

‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:For agentic workers: work through the›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:steps in order and tick each box when›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:its tests pass.›

‹Text,b:Goal:› ‹Code: gleam check › reads a built site
and reports every broken internal link,
with the page and line it came from.

‹Text,b:Architecture:›

  ‹Bullet:• ›A walker lists the pages under the
    output folder
  ‹Bullet:• ›A parser pulls every ‹Code: href › and
    ‹Code: src › out of each page
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›absolute URLs are skipped
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›fragments are checked against the
      page's own anchors
      ‹Bullet:▪ ›an anchor is any ‹Code: id › attribute
      ‹Bullet:▪ ›a heading gets one from its text
  ‹Bullet:• ›A reporter prints one line per
    broken link and sets the exit code

‹Text,b:Tech stack:› Go 1.27,
‹Code: golang.org/x/net/html ›, the standard
library otherwise.

‹Heading2,b:File structure›

‹TableFrame:╭──────────────────┬───────────────────╮›
