‹Heading2,b:Step 2: extract links›

  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Test the extractor on a page with
    every link shape
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›plain ‹Code: <a href> › and ‹Code: <img src> ›
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›a link with a fragment only
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›a link with a query string and a
      fragment
      ‹Bullet:▪ ›the query is ignored when the
        file is looked up
      ‹Bullet:▪ ›the fragment is checked against
        the target page
        ‹Bullet:▪ ›a missing anchor is a finding,
          a missing file is another
  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Implement it, then run ‹Code: make check ›
  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Commit

