  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Write the reporter and its golden
    test
  ‹TaskOpen:○ ›Wire ‹Code: gleam check › into the CLI

‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:Keep the reporter free of colour: the›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:CI log is plain text.›

‹Heading2,b:Notes›

  ‹Bullet:1. ›Do not follow redirects, a redirect
     page is a finding too
  ‹Bullet:2. ›Cap the walk at 100,000 pages
  ‹Bullet:3. ›Never write into the output folder
